Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)启程的时刻似乎到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)去吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)一定要… 一定要回来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一定要… 一定要平安回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)等着我 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定 会把你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么情况？ 这里是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 星光体世界 在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 真的能去成吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(彩虹栗子球)栗 栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸用过的 彩虹栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗 栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 啊…喂！ 等等!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(彩虹栗子球)栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道是想给我带路吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹栗球)栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太感谢了！拜托你了，虹栗球。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我带到星光界去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)果然，来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这里就是星光界？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是星光界的城镇…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是枯萎了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明城镇那么漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里简直就像废墟一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底搞什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你是谁？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)你是九十九游马吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为… 为什么知道我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是不该来到这个世界的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下啊 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是来战斗的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说 我不是敌人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《V说得没错》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((万一能去到星光界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里也是完全未知的世界…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会发生什么 谁也不知道))
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《看来这个世界并不欢迎我啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(彩虹栗子球)栗 栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗子球！ 栗栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彩虹栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.65,0:04:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德鲁贝)啊 没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德鲁贝)我在那之后 和纳修与梅拉古{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我的记忆被封印在遗迹里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我多次造访。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后一点点回想起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为巴里安之前的自己的记忆……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我们的确曾经是人类。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)怎么会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在遗迹中感受到的记忆是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)我们在那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为巴里安苏醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而如果遗迹的传说就是我们的记忆的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 从今往后要把纳修…… 把他夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 彩虹栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你知不知道星光在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃… 又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹栗球)栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜!? 这… 这边也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹栗球)栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被包围了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟… 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗球！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虹栗球！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在找星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 真是个缠人的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗球外！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗栗～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了要是你知道星光在哪儿…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸… 老爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸果然在这个星光世界啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。反正你肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到这个之后 感动得不行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少会抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一两句吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这段影像 是事先
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}设置好在彩虹栗子球里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在没空说我的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧去救星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光被判定为混沌了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他很快就会被抹消存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被抹消？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彩虹栗子球会带你去星光那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:07:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 能救星光的只有你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去救星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙：璃绪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们在那场事故中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的丢了性命吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 我和你 现在就在这里》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:08:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《为什么 遗迹传说中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现的家纹 会在我们老家里……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞不懂啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《到底发生了什么……》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…… 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)凌牙 不 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你觉醒的时候了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里 库里 库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～哥布林德巴格！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到星光界去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～好痛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是你这家伙 真烦人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 在这个世界里不该存在的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那算什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑。我一定要救出星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里库里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彩虹栗子球。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里到底是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里的话 可以暂时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}躲开追兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊  你是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)我叫艾娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生活在这个阿斯特拉尔世界的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾娜……那是你救了我吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:10:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……这到底是怎么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有一些人希望你能去拯救他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救？就凭我？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)大家都是这个世界的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且大家都身患疾病 再这样下去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当那生命之光还在闪耀的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕撑不了太久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这么多……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 你到底要我怎么做啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请触碰他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}触碰？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定 那时候的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了。有你的力量的话 一定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知 知道了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样行了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是从你那里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到了混沌之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之力？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个星灵世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不存在任何邪恶与憎恨。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个纯洁无瑕的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很久以前 星灵世界里也
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在着混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后来在数千年前将所有拥有混沌的灵魂 全部放逐{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由此诞生的 就是巴里安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也就是说… 那么。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.27,0:12:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。巴里安世界和星灵世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本是同一个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了自己而活的欲望之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要失去它，星光界就会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信能够升级
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从而舍弃了混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那是个错误。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之中，也包含着想要守护某人、
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要为某人而活下去、
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此祈愿的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:12:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)那才是生存之力，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是原始的生命之源。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，因为失去了它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界的力量就此变弱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就大家一起想办法不就好了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)那是做不到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光世界放逐了混沌，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一个只追求升级的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它创造出了艾利法斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)就是追着你来的那个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是这个世界的象征，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个只追求升级的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我吧，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马，来到这里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)是的，那位大人拯救了我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)用混沌的力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)没错。他向所有人伸出了援手。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去拯救星光……拯救这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((那个叫艾利法斯的自己亲手做出来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己却被逼得走投无路{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没什么办法了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)有的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有一个可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能性？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)那就是你与阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救这个世界唯一的可能性))
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！阿斯特拉尔！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是来接你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}醒醒啊，阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要睡到什么时候啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，一起回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)吾名艾利法斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追求这个世界理想之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从艾娜那里，我全都听说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，你就是阿斯特拉尔世界的代表吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就好说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿斯特拉尔从这里放出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这我做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔是为了消灭巴里安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这个世界引向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更高层次的升级而诞生的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此，他才必须
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}始终保持纯洁无瑕。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，他——被你的混沌玷污了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 必须将那个存在抹消掉才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我玷污了阿斯特拉尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被我？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确阿斯特拉尔或许已经改变了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那家伙才没有被玷污！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哭过笑过有时还吵过架{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我们确实一起战斗过来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦的时候悲伤的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论何时都在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我 是我们的重要羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这种家伙竟敢把它你懂个屁啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔，我一定会救出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你？怎么救？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔总是说。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗才是神圣的仪式！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，就用和我之间的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来赌上阿斯特拉尔吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以。与此同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你关于阿斯特拉尔的记忆也一并赌上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和阿斯特拉尔的记忆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求之不得！来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，仪式现在开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.95,0:17:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙是这世界的代表……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，至少也是星光体级别的绝对强得离谱。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就算这样，这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可绝对不能输！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动这两张永续魔法神秘之莫诺里斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以作为阶级4的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡竟然能当超量素材！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用两张神秘之莫诺里斯进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两张卡构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，阶级4的新秩序！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太阿努比斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新秩序……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是那家伙的超量……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……上了！！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗 栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虹栗球！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……你也要一起和我并肩作战吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗 栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 顽皮骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我将影蜥蜴特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在等级４的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级４的顽皮骑士和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗……希望皇 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 No.正是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你与Astral的相遇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是由Irregular诞生的异物。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Hope才不是什么异物！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和Astral的相遇……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是什么Irregular!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个Hope正是我和Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一同培育出来的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，那就连同那份希望一起粉碎殆尽吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:19:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《糟了。得冷静下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.48,0:20:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的怪兽攻击力只有1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤那种攻击力的怪兽出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定有什么……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((Astral：游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就按你自己的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽情热血沸腾就好))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 我发动装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动反制破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡装备给霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我用霍普攻击阿努比斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间，装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反制破坏者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽在攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把对方魔法与陷阱区域的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这个时候，对方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能发动魔法、陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要破坏你的盖卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，上吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿努比斯破坏掉！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动以太阿努比斯的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:20:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当魔法与陷阱区域的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那张卡复活，并可以发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡 神秘之镜。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我受到的伤害……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由你来承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 希望的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.23,0:21:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让希望的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……看来你还有点本事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的决斗可是经过星光界锤炼的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 经过星光界锤炼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你赢不了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界世界真正的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡 也是由决斗者创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说… 这道光 莫非…。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀… 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.15,0:23:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.69,0:23:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.27,0:23:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.46,0:23:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.69,0:23:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
